<title>FRANCE: Schroder has 6.36 pct of Metaleurop voting rights.</title>
<headline>Schroder has 6.36 pct of Metaleurop voting rights.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Investment Management Ltd declared it had breached the five percent disclosure threshold and held 6.36 percent of the voting rights of Metaleurop, French bourse regulator Conseil des marches financiers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Metaleurop is controlled by German metals group Preussag.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
